# Ignore file for the Dockerfile.
#
# Exclude everything, then add back only what the Dockerfile copies.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src
!prompts
!config
!migrations
!docs

# Re-exclude things that would otherwise ride along inside the paths above.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.venv
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov

# Never, under any circumstances, into the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets
**/*.pem
